<JournalSupport title="About Field &amp; Farm" summary="Independent tools for planning, calculating and tracking your farm.">
<div class="panel journal-support-card"><h2>What we build</h2><p>Field &amp; Farm is an unofficial fan-tool project for Stardew Valley players. The toolkit includes a schematic farm planner, reference calculators and collection checklists. No account is required.</p><h2>Data and scope</h2><p>Game-specific reference rules are identified in each tool. The eight built-in terrain references use functional restriction flags from the pinned Starplan reference and independently drawn artwork. Original practice maps are not official maps, and unsupported game versions or missing fields are not assumed to be accurate. See the tool-specific limitations before using the results.</p><p>Artwork uses independently made illustrations and credited free assets. See <a href="/art/credits.html">artwork credits</a>. Stardew Valley and its original assets belong to ConcernedApe LLC. Field &amp; Farm is unofficial and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by ConcernedApe. Original game artwork is not included; the current preview has no advertising. Commercial permission for game-derived terrain data is not yet confirmed.</p><p><a href="/contact/">Report a problem</a> · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></p></div></JournalSupport>
